# .dockerignore: files Docker must NOT send into the build ("build context").
# A smaller context means faster builds, and the image never contains your local junk.

# Installed inside the image with `npm ci`. Copying the Mac's copy could bring in wrong-platform binaries.
node_modules
npm-debug.log
# Git history isn't needed in the image (and can be large).
.git
# Docs aren't needed to run or test the app.
*.md
# NOTE: "test" is deliberately NOT ignored. The test stage (`docker build --target test`) needs it.
